Alongside the UI and visual design, the redesign also renewed the underlying technology. Together with the team, we went through the analytics and the most-used search filters, and based on those I conceptualized and designed a wireframe for the new features.

Design and technical production worked in close collaboration, delivering a result that pleased the client and met their expectations.
